Cell["\<\
On the binary tree of depth 3 each of the four vertices above the leaves has \
two legs and needs a vertex on one of them:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"00e94288-79f0-4276-88c9-7b0621745e5c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

